# Issue 3 — DTO Naming ⭐⭐⭐⭐

`AccountDTO`

is misleading.

DTO usually means

```
Database

REST API

Network

Request/Response
```

It shouldn't represent your domain object.

Better names:

```
AccountInfo

AccountDetails

or simply remove it.
```

